300 0 obj
<<
/Type /StructElem
/S /P
/P 262 0 R
/E (Many options exist for creating digital archives and digital exhibits for your research in the humanities. This session will guide participants through the pros and cons of various free and paid digital archive and exhibit tools and platforms like WordPress, Omeka, CollectionBuilder, ArcGIS Storymaps, Quire, and Wax. Special attention will be paid to evaluating your own source material, needs, and priorities to find the best tool for you and your project.)
/Pg 11 0 R
/K [1]
>>
endobj
